hadiths[40]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (R.A) ne kaha: Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne farmaya: ""Jab Allah ne khalq ki takhleeq mukammal farma di, toh apni kitaab mein apne oopar likh diya, jo un ke paas rakha gaya hai: 'Be-shak meri rahmat mere ghadab par ghalib hai.'"" (Isay) Muslim (ne riwayat kiya hai) (aur isi tarah Bukhari, Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne bhi)."
"2","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radiyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Aadam ki aulaad ne meri takzeeb ki halaanke usko iska haq na tha, aur mujhe shatm di halaanke usko iska haq na tha. Amma takzeeb-e-eya meri to yeh qoul hai ke woh mujhe dobara waisa hi karega jaisa pehle paida kiya, aur makhlooq ki pehli paidaish meri nazar mein iski dobara paidaish se aasaan nahi hai. Aur amma shatm-e-eya meri to yeh qoul hai ke Allah ne aulaad ikhtiyar ki, aur main Ahad aur Samad hoon, na main ne jan diya aur na mujhe jana gaya, aur na mera koi kufu hai.\n(Isay Imam Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai aur Imam Nasai ne bhi)"
"3","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (R.A) farmate hain ke Rasoolullah (S.A.W) ne Hudaibiya mein hamein namaz-e-Subh parhayi, jo raat ko baarish hui thi. Jab Nabi (S.A.W) namaz se farig hue toh logon ki taraf mutawajjuh hue aur farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho tumhare Rabb ne kya farmaya?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Allah aur uske Rasool behtar jaante hain."" Farmaya: ""Mere bandon mein se aaj subah ek mera mumin hai aur ek kafir. Toh jisne kaha: 'Humein Allah ke fazl aur rehmat se baarish hui', toh woh mera mumin hai aur sitare ka kafir hai. Aur jisne kaha: 'Humein falan aur falan sitare se baarish hui', toh woh mera kafir hai aur sitare ka mumin hai.""\nRiwayat Bukhari (aur isi tarah Malik aur Nasai)."
"4","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah raziyallahu anhu farmate hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Banu Aadam dahr ko galiyan dete hain, aur main hi dahr hoon, mere haath mein raat aur din hain. Isay Bukhari (aur saath hi Muslim) ne riwayat kiya hai."
"5","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah raziyallahu anhu farmate hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne farmaya: Main saajhedaaron mein shirk se sab se be-niyaaz hoon; jis shakhs ne koi amal kiya aur us mein mere saath kisi aur ko sharik kiya, toh main ne usko aur uske shirk ko chhod diya. Isay Muslim (aur saath hi Ibn-e-Majah) ne riwayat kiya hai."
"6","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Qayamat ke din jin logon ka sab se pehle hissa hoga un mein ek woh shakhs hai jise shahadat mili. Usay pesh kiya gaya, Allah ne usay apni ne'matein batain toh usne unhein pehchana. Farmaya: Tu ne un mein kya kiya? Usne kaha: Maine tere liye ladta hua shahadat haasil ki. Farmaya: Tu jhoota hai, balke tu is liye lada t ke kaha jaye: Ye bahadur hai. Ab ye keh diya gaya. Phir usay hukm diya gaya aur woh mun ke bal ghasita gaya yahan tak ke aag mein daal diya gaya. Aur ek shakhs jisne 'ilm seekha, sikhaya aur Qur'an parha. Usay pesh kiya gaya, Allah ne usay apni ne'matein batain toh usne unhein pehchana. Farmaya: Tu ne un mein kya kiya? Usne kaha: Maine 'ilm seekha aur sikhaya, aur tere liye Qur'an parha. Farmaya: Tu jhoota hai, balke tu ne 'ilm is liye seekha ke kaha jaye: Ye 'alim hai, aur tune Qur'an is liye parha ke kaha jaye: Ye qari hai. Ab ye keh diya gaya. Phir usay hukm diya gaya aur woh mun ke bal ghasita gaya yahan tak ke aag mein daal diya gaya. Aur ek shakhs jise Allah ne kushadgi di aur har qisam ka maal ata kiya. Usay pesh kiya gaya, Allah ne usay apni ne'matein batain toh usne unhein pehchana. Farmaya: Tu ne un mein kya kiya? Usne kaha: Jis raah mein tu pasand karta tha ke us mein karch kiya jaye, maine us mein tere liye karch kiya. Farmaya: Tu jhoota hai, balke tu ne ye is liye kiya ke kaha jaye: Ye sahay (daihal) hai. Ab ye keh diya gaya. Phir usay hukm diya gaya aur woh mun ke bal ghasita gaya, phir aag mein daal diya gaya. (Isay Muslim ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Tirmizi aur Nasa'i bhi)"
"7","[AI-translation] Uqbah bin Aamir (radi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Tumhara Rab ek gosha-band se heran hota hai jo pahaar ki choti par ho, namaz ki azan deta hai aur namaz padhta hai. Toh Allah Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Apne is banday ko dekho, azan deta hai aur namaz qaim karta hai, mujh se darta hai. Maine apne banday ki magfirat kar di aur usay jannat mein daal diya. (Isay Nasa'i ne sahi sanad se riwayat kiya hai)"
"8","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai, Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs namaz padhe aur us mein Umm-ul-Qur'an na padhe, toh wo namaz khaas (na mukammal) hai, teen martaba. Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu 'anhu) se poocha gaya: Hum toh Imam ke peeche hote hain. Unhon ne kaha: Apne dil mein parho, kyunke maine Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna hai: Allah Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Maine namaz ko apne aur apne banday ke darmiyan aadha aadha kar diya hai, aur mere banday ke liye hai jo wo maange. Pus jab banda kahe: {Alhamdu lillahi Rabb-il-'Alamin} toh Allah Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Mere banday ne meri tareef ki. Aur jab kahe: {Ar-Rahman-ir-Rahim} toh Allah Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Mere banday ne meri sifat ki. Aur jab kahe: {Maliki Yawm-id-Din} toh Allah farmata hai: Mere banday ne meri tajdeed ki (aur ek riwayat mein hai: Mere banday ne mujhe mukhtiyar mana). Aur jab kahe: {Iyyaka na'budu wa iyyaka nasta'in} toh farmata hai: Ye mere aur mere banday ke darmiyan hai, aur mere banday ke liye hai jo wo maange. Aur jab kahe: {Ihdinas-Sirat-al-Mustaqim, Sirat-alladhina an'amta 'alayhim ghayr-il-maghdubi 'alayhim wa la-ad-dallin} toh farmata hai: Ye mere banday ke liye hai, aur mere banday ke liye hai jo wo maange. (Isay Muslim ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Malik, Tirmizi, Abu Dawud, Nasa'i aur Ibn Majah bhi)"
"9","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din banday ke amaal mein sab se pehle uski namaz ka hissa hoga. Agar namaz sahih ho gayi toh woh kamyab aur faiyaz ho gaya, aur agar kharab ho gayi toh woh khasara mein padh gaya. Agar farz mein koi qasar hui, toh Rab Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Dekho ke kya mere banday ke paas koi nafl (tatawwu) hai jis se farz mein jo qasar hui hai poora kar di jaye? Phir uske baqi amaal isi tarah honge. (Isay Tirmizi ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Abu Dawud, Nasa'i, Ibn Majah aur Ahmed bhi)"
"10","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai, Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall farmata hai: Rozah meri khatir hota hai, aur main hi us ka badla deta hoon. Banda apni shahwat, khana aur peena meri wajah se chhod deta hai. Rozah dhaal hai, aur rozedar ke liye do khushiyan hain: ek khushi jab iftar karta hai, aur doosri khushi jab apne Rab se milta hai. Aur rozedar ke munh ki khusbu Allah ke nazdeek kasturi ki khushbu se behtar hai. (Isay Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Muslim, Malik, Tirmizi, Nasa'i aur Ibn Majah bhi)"
"11","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Razi Allahu 'Anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: Allah farmata hai: ""Ae Ibne Adam, kharch kar, Mein tum par kharch karunga."
"12","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ood Ansari (Razi Allahu 'Anhu) farmate hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: Tum se pehle guzre hue logon mein se ek shakhs ka muhasba hua, toh us mein koi nek ki na paayi gayi magar yeh ke wo logon se milna-julna rakhta tha, aur woh aasiib wala (dolat mand) tha, aur apne ghulaamon ko hukum deta tha ke muflis ko dheel de den. (Nabi Sallallahu 'Alaihi wa Sallam ne farmaya) Allah farmata hai: ""Hum is ke zyada haq daar hain, tum bhi usko dheel de do."" (Isay Muslim ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Bukhari aur Nasai bhi)."
"13","[AI-translation] 'Addi bin Hatim (Razi Allahu 'Anhu) farmate hain ke: Mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'Alaihi wa Sallam) ke paas tha, toh un ke paas do shakhs aaye. Ek tangdaasti ka shikwa karta tha aur doosra raah zani ka shikwa karta tha. Toh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu 'Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ""Raat kaatne ki baat toh yeh hai ke bohot jald tum par aisi haalat aa jayegi ke Makkah ki taraf qafile bina kisi hami (nigehbaan) ke niklenge. Aur tangdaasti ki baat yeh hai ke Qayamat tab tak nahi aayegi jab tak tum mein se koi apni sadaqa lekar ghoomega aur use qubool karne wala na payega. Phir tum mein se har shakhs Allah ke saamne khada hoga, us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan na koi parda hoga na koi tarjumaan hoga jo us ke liye tarjumaani kare. Phir Allah us se farmayega: Kya maine tujhe maal nahi diya tha? Wo kahayega: Balke diya tha. Phir farmayega: Kya maine tere paas Rasool nahi bheja tha? Wo kahayega: Balke bheja tha. Phir wo apni daahini taraf dekhega toh aag ke siwa kuch na dekhega, phir apni baahini taraf dekhega toh aag ke siwa kuch na dekhega. Toh tum mein se har shakhs ko chahiye ke aag se dare, agarche aadhi khajoor (kharjur) ke zariye se hi kyun na ho, aur agar wo na paye toh acchi baat ke zariye (dare)."" (Isay Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai)."
"14","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Razi Allahu 'Anhu) se riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu 'Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala ke kuch sair karne wale farishte hote hain jo zikr ki majalis ko talash karte hain. Toh jab unhein koi aisi majlis mil jaye jisme zikr ho, toh wo un ke saath baith jate hain, aur apne paron se ek doosre ko gher lete hain, yahan tak ke jo jagah un ke aur asman-e-duniya ke darmiyan hai, use bhar dete hain. Phir jab wo uth chalte hain, toh asman ki taraf oonche hote aur chadh jate hain. Farmaya: Allah 'Azza wa Jall un se (halanke wo un se zyada waaqif hai) poochta hai: Tum kahan se aaye ho? Wo kehte hain: Zameen mein tere bandon ke paas se aaye hain jo teri tasbeeh karte hain, takbeer kehte hain, tahleel kehte hain, teri hamd karte hain aur tujh se sawal karte hain. Allah farmata hai: Woh mujh se kya maangte hain? Wo kehte hain: Wo teri jannat maangte hain. Allah farmata hai: Kya unhon ne meri jannat dekhi hai? Wo kehte hain: Nahi, ai Rabb! Allah farmata hai: Agar unhone meri jannat dekhi hoti toh kaisa hota! Wo kehte hain: Aur tujh se panah maangte hain. Allah farmata hai: Kis cheez se panah maangte hain? Wo kehte hain: Ai Rabb, teri aag se. Allah farmata hai: Kya unhon ne meri aag dekhi hai? Wo kehte hain: Nahi. Allah farmata hai: Agar unhone meri aag dekhi hoti toh kaisa hota! Wo kehte hain: Aur tujh se magfirat ki darkhwast karte hain. Farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Main ne un ko magfirat kar di, aur unhein wo cheez ata kar di jo wo maangte the, aur un ko us cheez se panah de di jis se wo panah chahte the. Farmaya: Wo (farishte) kehte hain: Ai Rabb, un mein fulaan aadmi bhi tha, jo ek ghalti karne wala banda tha, bas guzra tha aur un ke saath baith gaya tha. Farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Us ki bhi magfirat kar di; yeh woh log hain jis ke saath baithne wala kabhi badbakht nahi hota. (Isay Muslim ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Bukhari, Tirmizi aur Nasai bhi)."
"15","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Razi Allahu 'Anhu) farmate hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu 'Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Main apne bande ke mere baare mein guman ke mutabiq hoon. Aur jab wo mera zikr karta hai toh main us ke saath hota hoon. Toh agar wo mera zikr apne aap mein kare, toh main us ka zikr apne aap mein karunga. Aur agar wo mera zikr kisi jamghat mein kare, toh main us ka zikr un se behtar jamghat mein karunga. Aur agar wo ek angusht mere qareeb aaye, toh main ek haath us ke qareeb aaunga. Aur agar wo ek haath mere qareeb aaye, toh main ek baazoo us ke qareeb aaunga. Aur agar wo chal kar mere paas aaye, toh main daurta hua us ke paas aaunga. (Isay Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Muslim, Tirmizi aur Ibn Majah bhi)."
"16","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas radi Allahu 'anhuma se riwayat hai, Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se, jo kuch unhone apne Rabb 'azza wa jall se riwayat kiya, farmaya: ""Allah ne nekiyon aur buraiyon ko likh diya, phir usay wazeh farmaya: pas jis shakhs ne kisi neki ka irada kiya aur usay amal na kiya, Allah ne usay apne yahan mukammal neki likh di. Pas agar usne uska irada kiya aur amal kar diya, to Allah ne usay apne yahan das nekiyan likh di, saat so darj tak, aur kayi darj tak. Aur jisne kisi burai ka irada kiya aur usay amal na kiya, Allah ne usay apne yahan mukammal neki likh di. Pas agar usne uska irada kiya aur amal kar diya, to Allah ne ek burai likh di."" (Isay Bukhari aur Muslim ne riwayat kiya)."
"17","[AI-translation] Abu Zar Ghifari radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai, Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se, jo kuch unhone apne Rabb 'azza wa jall se riwayat kiya ke woh farmate hain:\n""Aye mere bandon! Maine apni zaat par zulm haram kiya aur ise tumhare darmiyan haram kiya hai, pas ek dusre par zulm na karo.\nAye mere bandon! Tum sab gumrah ho, siwaye uske jise main ne hidayat di, pas mujh se hidayat talab karo, main tumhe hidayat dunga.\nAye mere bandon! Tum sab bhooke ho, siwaye uske jise main ne khilaya, pas mujh se khana talab karo, main tumhe khilaunga.\nAye mere bandon! Tum sab nange ho, siwaye uske jise main ne kapde pehnaye, pas mujh se kapde talab karo, main tumhe kapde pehnaunga.\nAye mere bandon! Tum raat din galtiyan karte ho, aur main tamam gunah maaf karta hoon, pas mujh se magfirat talab karo, main tumhe maaf karunga.\nAye mere bandon! Tum kabhi mera nuqsan nahi pohancha sakte mujhe nuqsan pahunchane ke liye, aur kabhi mera faida nahi pohancha sakte mujhe faida pahunchane ke liye.\nAye mere bandon! Agar tumhare awwal aur aakhir, tumhare insaan aur jinnat kisi ek shakhs ke sab se zyada parhezgaar dil par hote to bhi yeh meri badshahat mein kuch izafa na karta.\nAye mere bandon! Agar tumhare awwal aur aakhir, tumhare insaan aur jinnat kisi ek shakhs ke sab se zyada fujjur dil par hote to bhi yeh meri badshahat mein kuch kami na karta.\nAye mere bandon! Agar tumhare awwal aur aakhir, tumhare insaan aur jinnat ek hi maidan mein kharhe ho kar mujh se mangte aur main har ek ko uski maang ata kar deta, to jo mere paas hai usmein se is tarah kami na aati jis tarah ek sui jab samandar mein utaari jaye to samandar mein kami na aati.\nAye mere bandon! Yeh tumhare aamal hain, main unhe tumhare liye mehfooz karta hoon, phir tumhe unka poora poora badla dunga. Pas jise khair mile, usay Allah ka shukr karna chahiye, aur jise iske siwa kuch mile, usay apne siwa kisi ko maloom na kare.""\n(Isay Muslim (aur isi tarah Tirmidhi aur Ibn Majah) ne riwayat kiya)."
"18","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira radi Allahu 'anhu kehte hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya:\n""Allah 'azza wa jall qayamat ke din farmayega: Aye Ibn Adam! Main bimar hua to tum ne mera ilaaj nahi kiya. (Insaan) kahega: Aye mere Rabb! Main tera ilaaj kaise karun aur tu Rabb-ul-Aalameen hai? Farmayega: Kya tumhein maloom nahi tha ke mera banda fulan bimar hua aur tum ne uska ilaaj nahi kiya? Kya tumhein maloom nahi tha ke agar tum uska ilaaj karte to mujhe uske paas paate. Aye Ibn Adam! Maine tum se khana mangi to tum ne mujhe khana nahi khilaya. Kahega: Aye mere Rabb! Main tujhe kaise khilaun aur tu Rabb-ul-Aalameen hai? Farmayega: Kya tumhein maloom nahi ke mera banda fulan ne tum se khana manga aur tum ne usay khana nahi khilaya? Kya tumhein maloom nahi ke agar tum usay khilate to yeh (sawab) apne paas paate. Aye Ibn Adam! Maine tum se pani mangi to tum ne mujhe pani nahi pilaya. Kahega: Aye mere Rabb! Main tujhe kaise pilaun aur tu Rabb-ul-Aalameen hai? Farmayega: Mera banda fulan tum se pani mangne aaya aur tum ne usay pani nahi pilaya. Be-shak agar tum usay pani pilate to yeh apne paas paate.""\n(Isay Muslim ne riwayat kiya)."
"19","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya:\n""Allah 'azza wa jall farmata hai: Kibriya mere chadar hai aur azmat meri izaar hai. Pas jis shakhs ne in dono mein se kisi ek mein mujh se takabbur kiya, main usay Naar mein daal dunga.""\n(Isay Abu Dawud (aur isi tarah Ibn Majah aur Ahmad) ne sahi asanid se riwayat kiya hai)."
"20","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya:\n""Jannat ke darwaze pir ke din aur jumeraat ke din khole jate hain, to har us bande ki magfirat ki jati hai jo Allah ke sath kisi ko sharik nahi banata, siwaye us shakhs ke jis ke darmiyan aur uske bhai ke darmiyan koi dushmani ho. To farmaya jata hai: In dono ko multavi rakho yahan tak ke dono aapas mein sulah kar lein, in dono ko multavi rakho yahan tak ke dono aapas mein sulah kar lein, in dono ko multavi rakho yahan tak ke dono aapas mein sulah kar lein.""\n(Isay Muslim (aur isi tarah Malik aur Abu Dawud) ne riwayat kiya)."
"21","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ta'ala farmata hai: Teen log aise hain jin ka main qayamat ke din khasm (mukhalif) hoon: Ek shakhs jo mere naam par (kuch) de kar phir ghaddari kare, aur ek shakhs jo ek azaad aadmi ko ba kar us ki qemat khaye, aur ek shakhs jis ne kisi mazdoor ko muqarrar kiya, phir us se (kaam) poora le aur us ki mazdoori na de. (Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Ibn Majah aur Ahmed ne bhi)"
"22","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'eed radi Allahu 'anhu farmate hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni zaat ko haqeer na samjhe. (Sahaba ne) arz kiya: Ya Rasoolallah! Hum mein se koi apni zaat ko kaise haqeer samajhta hai? Farmaya: Kisi baat mein Allah ke hukm ko dekhe ke us mein kehne ki gunjaish hai phir (bawajood is ke) us mein kuch na kahe. To qayamat ke din Allah 'azza wa jall use farmayega: Kya cheez tujhe rok saki ke tu falan falan baat mein (haq) na kahe? Wo kahega: Logon ka khauf. Farmaya: Pas Mujhe hi tujhe zyada khauf karna chahiye tha. (Ise Ibn Majah ne sahi sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai)"
"23","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radi Allahu 'anhu farmate hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah tabaraka wa ta'ala qayamat ke din farmayega: Mere jalaal ki wajah se ek dusre se mohabbat karne wale kahan hain? Aaj un ko meri parchhaaee mein parchhaaee dunga us din jab kisi parchhaaee ke siwa meri parchhaaee nahi hogi. (Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Maalik ne bhi)"
"24","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radi Allahu 'anhu farmate hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande se mohabbat karta hai, to Jibrail ko bulata hai aur farmata hai: Main fulan se mohabbat karta hoon, tu bhi us se mohabbat kar. Jibrail us se mohabbat karte hain, phir aasman mein nida karte hain: Allah fulan se mohabbat karta hai, tum bhi us se mohabbat karo. To aasman walon se us ki mohabbat ki jati hai. Phir zameen mein us ke liye qubooliyat rakh di jati hai. Aur jab Allah kisi bande se na-razee (bughd) karta hai, to Jibrail ko bulata hai aur farmata hai: Main fulan se na-razee hoon, tu bhi na-razee ho ja. Jibrail us se na-razee ho jate hain, phir aasman walon mein nida karte hain: Allah fulan se na-razee hai, tum bhi na-razee ho jao. To aasman walay us se na-razee ho jate hain, phir zameen mein us ke liye na-razee (bughd) rakh di jati hai. (Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya hai, aur isi tarah Bukhari, Maalik aur Tirmizi ne bhi)"
"25","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah radi Allahu 'anhu farmate hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah 'azza wa jall ne farmaya: Jis ne mere kisi wali ki dushmani ki, to main ne us se jang ka ilaan kar diya. Aur mera banda aisi kisi cheez ke zariye mere nazdeek nahi hota jo main ne us par farz ki hai. Aur mera banda nafl (ibaadaat) ke zariye mere nazdeek hota rehta hai yahan tak ke main us se mohabbat karne laga. Phir jab main us se mohabbat kar laga, to main us ka kan ho jata hoon jis se wo sunta hai, aur us ki aankh ho jata hoon jis se wo dekhta hai, aur us ka haath ho jata hoon jis se wo pakar leta hai, aur us ka paer ho jata hoon jis se wo chalta hai. Aur agar wo mujh se kuch maange, to main zaroor us ko dunga, aur agar wo mujh se panaah maange, to main zaroor us ko panaah dunga. Aur kisi aisi cheez ke baare mein jise main karne wala hoon, main utni hichkichahat nahi karta jitni main apne momin bande ki jaan (lenay) ke waqt karta hoon, halanke wo maut ko na-pasand karta hai aur main us ki masa'at (takleef) ko na-pasand karta hoon. (Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya hai)"
"26","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai ke Nabi Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Allah Azz wa Jall farmata hai: Mere auliya mein mere nazdeek sab se zyada rashk layak woh momin hai jo khafif-ul-khaaz (patla o halka badan wala) ho, namaz ka hissa rakhta ho, apne Rab ki ibadat behtareen karta ho, khufiya taur par Uski itaat karta ho aur logon mein pinhaan rehta ho, uski taraf ungliyon se ishara na kiya jaye, uski rozi-roti kafi ho aur us par sabr karta ho. Phir Aap ne apna haath hilaya aur farmaya: Iski maut jaldi kardi gayi, is ke ronay walay kam hue, is ka tarakah (warasat) kam hua.\n(Tirmizi ne riwayat ki hai, aur waisi hi Ahmad aur Ibn Majah ne bhi, aur iski sanad hasan hai.)"
"27","[AI-translation] Masrooq se riwayat hai, kehte hain: Hum ne (ya maine) Abdullah (yani Ibn-e-Masood) se is aayat ke baray mein poocha: ""Aur tum un logon ko jo Allah ki raah mein qatal kiye gaye murda na samajho, balke wo apne Rab ke paas zinda hain aur unhe rozi di jati hai"". Unhon ne kaha: Yaqeenan hum ne bhi is bare mein poocha tha, to farmaya: Unki roohein sabz parindon ke andar hoti hain, jin ke liye arsh se latakta hue qandeel (chiragh) hain. Wo jannat mein jahan chahein ghumti phirti hain, phir unhi qandeelon ki taraf lot aati hain. Unka Rab un ki taraf mutawajjih hokar dekhta hai aur poochta hai: Kya tum koi cheez chahate ho? Wo kehte hain: Hum kya cheez chahate hain, jab ke hum jannat mein jahan chahein ghumti phirti hain? Yeh un ke sath teen dafa hua. Jab unhon ne dekha ke unhe sawal kiye bhi chhoda nahi jayega, to kehne lage: Ay Rab! Hum chahate hain ke Aap hamari roohein hamari jismon mein wapas kar dein, taake hum Aap ki raah mein ek aur martaba qatal kiye jayen. Jab (Allah ne) dekha ke unhe koi aur zaroorat nahi to unhe chho diya gaya.\n(Muslim ne riwayat ki hai, aur isi tarah Tirmizi, Nisai aur Ibn-e-Majah)"
"28","[AI-translation] Jundab bin Abdullah Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare qabl guzne walon mein ek aadmi tha jisay ek zakham laga. Woh (dard se) be-sabri ka shikar ho gaya, usne ek chaaku uthaya aur us se apna haath kaat liya, to khoon na ruka yahan tak ke woh mar gaya. Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mera banda mujh se apni jaan mein jaldi karta hai, main ne us par jannat haram kar di.\n(Bukhari ne riwayat ki hai.)"
"29","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Mere momin bande ke liye mere paas koi jaza nahi, jab main duniya walon mein se uska safiyy (chuninda bandah) utha loon aur woh (us par) sabr o ihtisab kare, bajoz-e-jannat.\n(Bukhari ne riwayat ki hai.)"
"30","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah Razi Allahu Anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Allah Azz wa Jall farmata hai: Jab mera banda mulaqa-e-mere se mohabbat kare, to main bhi us ke mulaqat se mohabbat karta hoon, aur jab mera banda mulaqa-e-mere se nafrat kare, to main bhi us ke mulaqat se nafrat karta hoon.\n(Bukhari aur Malik ne riwayat ki hai.)\nAur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein, jo hadith ke matan ko wazeh karti hai:\nAyesha Razi Allahu Anha se riwayat hai, kehti hain ke Rasool Allah Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Allah ka mulaqat chahata hai, Allah bhi us ka mulaqat chahata hai, aur jo Allah ka mulaqat se nafrat karta hai, Allah bhi us ka mulaqat se nafrat karta hai. Maine arz kiya: Ay Nabiy-e-Allah! Kya yeh mot se nafrat ki waja se hai? Sab hum mot se nafrat karte hain. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa nahi hai, lekin momin jab Allah ki rehmat, raza aur jannat ki basharat di jati hai, to woh Allah ka mulaqat chahata hai, pas Allah bhi us ka mulaqat chahata hai. Aur kafir jab Allah ke azaab aur gusse (sakht) ki basharat di jati hai, to woh Allah ka mulaqat se nafrat karta hai, pas Allah bhi us ka mulaqat se nafrat karta hai."
"31","[AI-translation] Jundub radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne bayan farmaya (ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Qasam Allah ki, Allah fulaan ko maaf nahi farmayega. To Allah ta'ala ne farmaya: Kaun hai jo mujh par ghuroor karta hai ke main fulaan ko maaf na karoon? To main ne fulaan ko maaf kar diya aur tere 'amal baatil kar diye (ya jaisa ke farmaya). Riwayat Muslim."
"32","[AI-translation] Abu Hurayrah radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se, farmaya: Ek shakhs apni jaan par asrat karta tha. Phir jab usay maut haawi hui to apne farzandon ko wasiyat karte hue kaha: Jab main mar jaaun to mujhe jala do, phir pis do, phir samandar mein uda do. Allah ki qasam, agar mere Rabb ne mujhe qaboo kar liya to aisi saza dalega jo kisi ko nahi di. Unhon ne waisa hi us ke sath kiya. Allah ne zameen ko farmaya: Jo liya hai wo lauta do. Pas wo (hayat ho kar) khada ho gaya. Allah ne us se farmaya: Tujhe kis cheez ne tere is 'amal par majboor kiya? Kaha: Aap ka khauf, ya Aap ki khauf. To Allah ne us ko is par maaf kar diya. Riwayat Muslim (aur isi tarah Bukhari, Nasa'i aur Ibn Majah bhi)."
"33","[AI-translation] Abu Hurayrah radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam se jo unhon ne apne Rabb 'Azza wa Jall ki taraf se bayan kiya, farmaya: Ek bande ne gunah kiya, to kaha: Allahumma aghfir li dhanbi. To Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mere bande ne gunah kiya, aur jaan liya ke us ka Rabb hai jo gunah maaf karta hai aur pakadta hai. Phir wapas gunah kiya, to kaha: Aye Rabbi, mera gunah maaf farma. To Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mere bande ne gunah kiya, aur jaan liya ke us ka Rabb hai jo gunah maaf karta hai aur pakadta hai. Phir wapas gunah kiya, to kaha: Aye Rabbi, mera gunah maaf farma. To Tabarak wa Ta'ala ne farmaya: Mere bande ne gunah kiya, aur jaan liya ke us ka Rabb hai jo gunah maaf karta hai aur pakadta hai. Jo chaho 'amal kar, maine tujhe maaf kar diya. Riwayat Muslim (aur isi tarah Bukhari bhi)."
"34","[AI-translation] Anas radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai, farmaya: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah ta'ala farmata hai: Aye Ibne Adam! Tu jab mujhe pukarta aur mujh se ummeed rakhta hai, to main tujhe maaf kar deta hoon jo kuch tere paas hai, aur mujhe koi parwaah nahi. Aye Ibne Adam! Agar tere gunah asmaan ki unchaai tak pahunch jayen phir tu mujh se istighfar kare, to main tujhe maaf kar doonga. Aye Ibne Adam! Agar tu zameen bhar ke gunah le kar mere paas aaye, phir aisi haalat mein mujh se mile ke tu mujh ke sath kisi cheez ka shirk na karta ho, to main zameen bhar ki maghfirat le kar tere paas aaunga. Riwayat Tirmidhi (aur isi tarah Ahmad bhi) aur is ki sanad hasan hai."
"35","[AI-translation] Abu Hurayrah radi Allahu 'anhu se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hamara Rabb Tabarak wa Ta'ala har raat duniya ke asmaan par nazil hota hai jab raat ka aakhri teesra hissa baqi hota hai, to farmata hai: Kaun hai jo mujhe pukare taake main us ki dawat utha loon? Kaun hai jo mujh se maange taake main use ata karoon? Kaun hai jo mujh se maghfirat maange taake main use maaf kar doon? Riwayat Bukhari (aur isi tarah Muslim, Malik, Tirmidhi aur Abu Dawood bhi). Aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein ziyada hai: Pas yahi silsila rahe jab tak ke fajr roshn na ho jaye."
"36","[AI-translation] Anas (r.a.) se riwayat hai, Nabi (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din momin jama honge aur kahenge: Kaash hum apne Rubb se shifaat talab karte. Pas woh Adam (a.s.) ke paas aayenge, aur kahenge: Tum insaano ke waalid ho, Allah ne tumhe apne haath se paida kiya, apne farishton ko tumhe sajda karwaya, aur tumhein har cheez ke naam sikhaye, toh apne Rubb ke paas hamari shifaat karo taake humein is makam (jagah) se aaraam de diya jaye. Woh kahenge: Main yahan nahi - aur woh apna gunah yaad karenge aur sharminda honge - Nuh (a.s.) ke paas jao, kyunke woh pehle rasool hain jinhe Allah zameen walon ki taraf bheja. Pas woh unke paas aayenge toh woh kahenge: Main yahan nahi - aur woh woh sawaal yaad karenge jo unhon ne apne Rubb se kiya tha jo unhe ilm nahi tha, aur sharminda honge - phir kahenge: Rehman ke khalil (Ibrahim a.s.) ke paas jao. Woh unke paas aayenge toh woh kahenge: Main yahan nahi, Musa (a.s.) ke paas jao, woh Allah ke woh banday hain jin se Allah ne kalam kiya aur jinko Taurat ata ki. Woh unke paas aayenge toh woh kahenge: Main yahan nahi - aur woh na-haq kisi jaan ko qatl karna yaad karenge aur apne Rubb se sharminda honge - phir kahenge: Isa (a.s.) ke paas jao, jo Allah ke banday aur rasool hain, aur Allah ka kalima aur rooh hain. Woh unke paas aayenge toh woh kahenge: Main yahan nahi, Muhammad (s.a.w.) ke paas jao, jo woh banday hain jinhe Allah ne unka pichla aur aane wala gunah maaf kar diya. Pas woh mere paas aayenge, toh main nikloonga yahan tak ke apne Rubb se ijazat maangoon pas ijazat de di jayegi. Phir jab main apne Rubb ko dekhoonga toh sajda mein gir padhoonga. Phir Allah mujhe jaisa chaho chhod de. Phir kaha jayega: Apna sar uthao, maango tumhein mil jayega, aur kaho sun li jayegi, aur shifaat karo qabool hogi. Toh main apna sar uthaoonga aur un hamd ki tareef karoonga jo woh mujhe sikhayenge, phir shifaat karoonga toh woh mera ek had muqarrar kar denge, pas main unhe jannat mein daal doonga. Phir main unke paas laut aaoonga, pas jab main apne Rubb ko dekhoonga toh usi tarah sajda mein gir padhoonga, phir shifaat karoonga toh woh mera had muqarrar karenge, pas main unhe jannat mein daal doonga. Phir main teesri baar laut aaoonga, phir chauthi baar laut aaoonga aur kahoon: Jahannam mein wohi baqi hai jise Qur'an ne rokk rakha hai aur jis par khulood (hamesha rehna) wajib ho gaya hai.\nIsay Bukhari (aur waisi hi Muslim, Tirmizi aur Ibn Majah) ne riwayat kiya hai. Aur Bukhari ki ek aur riwayat mein yeh mazeed hai:\nNabi (s.a.w.) ne farmaya: Jahannam se woh niklega jisne kaha: La ilaha illallah, aur jiske dil mein neki ki wazn jaw (jaun) ke daane ke barabar hogi. Phir jahannam se woh niklega jisne kaha: La ilaha illallah, aur jiske dil mein neki ki wazn gandum ke daane ke barabar hogi. Phir jahannam se woh niklega jisne kaha: La ilaha illallah, aur jiske dil mein neki ki wazn raai (sarson) ke daane ke barabar hogi."
"37","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (r.a.) se riwayat hai, keh rahe hain: Rasoolullah (s.a.w.) ne farmaya:\nAllah farmata hai: Maine apne saaleh bandon ke liye aisi cheez tayyar ki hai jo kisi aankh ne nahi dekhi, kisi kaan ne nahi suni, aur kisi bashar (insaan) ke dil par guzri nahi. Pas agar chaho toh parho: ""Toh koi jaan nahi jaanti unhon ke liye kya chupaya gaya hai jo unhein aankhon ki thandak (khushi) degi.""\nIsay Bukhari aur Muslim aur Tirmizi aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya hai."
"38","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (r.a.) se riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (s.a.w.) se, farmaya:\nJab Allah ne jannat aur jahannam ko paida kiya, toh Jibreel (a.s.) ko jannat ki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Is dekho aur us cheez ko bhi dekho jo main ne is mein uske ahal (rahaane walon) ke liye muhaiyya ki hai. Kaha: Pas woh us mein aaya aur usay dekha aur us cheez ko dekha jo Allah ne uske ahal ke liye us mein muhaiyya ki thi. Kaha: Phir woh Allah ki taraf laut aaya, kaha: Aap ki izzat ki qasam, koi shakhs isay sunega magar is mein daakhil ho jayega. Phir Allah ne is ke mutaliq hukm diya pas ise makarahat (na-pasandidagi / mushkilaat) se gher diya gaya. Farmaya: Is ki taraf laut aur dekh jo main ne uske ahal ke liye is mein tayyar kiya hai. Kaha: Woh is ki taraf laut aaya, pas yeh makarahat se gheri hui thi. Woh laut aaya aur kaha: Aap ki izzat ki qasam, mujhe dar hai ke koi is mein daakhil na ho. Farmaya: Jahannam ki taraf jaa aur usay dekh aur us cheez ko dekh jo main ne uske ahal ke liye us mein tayyar ki hai. Pas yeh (aag) ek doosre par chadhi hui thi. Woh laut aaya aur kaha: Aap ki izzat ki qasam, koi shakhs isay sunega magar is mein daakhil ho jayega. Phir Allah ne hukm diya aur ise shahawat (khawahishaat) se gher diya gaya. Farmaya: Is ki taraf laut. Woh laut aaya aur kaha: Aap ki izzat ki qasam, mujhe khauf hai ke koi is se nijaat na paaye magar is mein daakhil ho jayega.\nIsay Tirmizi ne riwayat kiya hai aur kaha yeh hadith hasan sahih hai. Aur waisi hi Abu Dawood aur Nasai ne (riwayat ki hai)."
"39","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (r.a.) se riwayat hai, Nabi (s.a.w.) se, farmaya:\nJannat aur jahannam ne bahas ki. Pas jahannam ne kaha: Mere darmiyan jabbaar aur ghamand karne wale hain. Aur jannat ne kaha: Mere darmiyan kamzor log aur miskeen hain. Phir Allah ne un dono mein faisla kiya: Tum jannat meri rahmat ho, main tum se jise chaahon rahmat karoonga, aur tum jahannam meri azaab ho, main tum se jise chaahon azaab doonga. Aur tum dono ka mujh par poora hona lazim hai.\n(Isay Muslim (aur waisi hi Bukhari aur Tirmizi) ne riwayat kiya hai.)"
"40","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (r.a.) se riwayat hai, keh rahe hain: Nabi (s.a.w.) ne farmaya:\nAllah jannat walon se farmata hai: Aye jannat walo! Pas woh kahenge: Labbaik aye hamare Rubb aur sa'daik (huzoori), aur khair aapke haathon mein hai. Farmayega: Kya tum razi ho gaye? Woh kahenge: Hame kya hua ke hum razi na hon aye Rubb, jabke aapne hame woh ata kiya hai jo aapne apni makhlooq mein kisi ko nahi diya. Farmayega: Kya main tumhein is se behtar cheez na ata karoon? Woh kahenge: Aye Rubb aur is se behtar kya cheez hai? Farmayega: Main tum par apni raza (khushi) naazil karoonga, jis ke baad main tum par hamesha kabhi na-khush (ghussa) nahi karoonga.\nIsay Bukhari (aur waisi hi Muslim aur Tirmizi) ne riwayat kiya hai.\n"
